function flatten over T takes list of list of T xss returns list of T is
    constant result is empty list of T
    repeat with xs in xss
        repeat with x in xs
            append x to result
        end repeat
    end repeat
    return result
end function

constant nums is the result of flatten list of (list of 1, 2), (list of 3, 4)
say nums
constant words is the result of flatten list of (list of "a"), (list of "b", "c")
say words
